NOTE ON PDF FILES
-----------------
The PDF files under `pdfs/en/` are the authors' original papers, redistributed
here for research convenience; their copyright remains with the respective
authors and publishers. The files under `pdfs/zh/` are machine translations of
those papers produced by SuperTranslate + Qwen2.5-32B; they are derivative works
of the originals and inherit the originals' licensing constraints. Neither set is
covered by the CC0 dedication above, which applies only to the curation,
notes, insights, and scripts authored in this repository.
